# Medieval decisions that only this era has: its troops that the shared decisions (realms.lil)
# do not raise.

decision raise_gunners
    label Raise arquebusiers
    for realm
    target owned
    if foes is 0
    do raise gunners
    do map Happiness add -$conscription
    weight 1.2
    weight threat 0.5
    weight balance Funds $thrift
    weight army -$army_weight
    weight map Happiness 0.004
end
